Not necessarily.  Cc: isn't part of the Usenet Standard for Interchange.
There's no reason (or obligation) for it to be honored by a newsserver,
or even for it to reach the newsserver.  Since most newsservers would
let it through unmolested anyway, though, it's more likely that your
client takes care of it and never passes it on.  

